# Sprinting, reference behaviours decided in #821 (SPEC Sprinting, "Sprinting in the
# reference version"; docs/design/sprinting.md Phase B). A sim tick is 50 ms, so
# `frame 50 xN` steps are N ticks apart. The default double-tap window is 7 ticks:
# the second press may come at most 6 ticks after the first.

case a second press 6 ticks after the first starts a sprint
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x6
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true

case a second press 7 ticks after the first does not
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x7
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = false

case holding forward and back together ends the sprint
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true
down KeyS
frame 50
expect sprinting = false

case strafing with no forward key ends the sprint
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true
up KeyW
down KeyA
frame 50
expect sprinting = false

case forward plus a strafe key keeps the sprint
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true
down KeyA
frame 50 x2
expect sprinting = true

case a sprint continues in the air while forward is held
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x4
expect sprinting = true
press Space
frame 50 x2
expect eye.y > 1.7
expect sprinting = true

case a walking jump covers a set distance
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
down KeyW
frame 50 x8
mark
press Space
frame 50 x10
expect moved.z < -2.1
expect moved.z > -2.2

case a sprint-jump moves farther than a walking jump
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x8
expect sprinting = true
mark
press Space
frame 50 x10
expect moved.z < -2.6

case releasing forward on the jump tick gives no push
start walk raft
click
lock
runway 12
press KeyW
frame 50 x2
down KeyW
frame 50 x8
expect sprinting = true
mark
up KeyW
press Space
frame 50 x10
expect moved.z > -1.5
